sentences.text:
Considering all the facts and circumstances of the case, arguments advanced by both the parties,
nature of allegation as also taking note of the fact that allegation against the applicant is that he forged the Adhar Card, which was originally in the name of Sangita Dave; he also manipulated the same; Sangita Dave (PW-2) did not state anything against present applicant; she categorically stated in para - 19 of her statement that present applicant did not commit such act; all prosecution witnesses have turned hostile and not supported the prosecution case; the applicant is already facing trial for last one and half years; twenty five witnesses are yet to be examined before the trial Court;
co-accused Deepak has already been enlarged on bail by Hon'ble Supreme Court and case of present applicant is identical to the case of co-accused Deepak, therefore, on the ground of parity, I deem it proper to release the accused / applicant on bail.
